	<entry>
		<title type="html"><![CDATA[Réponse à&#160;:  Bloat ...]]></title>
		<link rel="alternate" href="http://forums.postgresql.fr/viewtopic.php?pid=15687#p15687"/>
		<content type="html"><![CDATA[<p>Bonjour,</p><p>J&#039;utilise cette requête : </p><div class="codebox"><pre><code>select
	current_database(),
	schemaname || &#039;.&#039; || relname as table,
	to_char(last_vacuum,&#039;DD-MM-YYYY HH24:mi&#039;) as lastvacuum,
	to_char(last_autovacuum,&#039;DD-MM-YYYY HH24:mi&#039;) as lastautovacuum,
	to_char(last_analyze,&#039;DD-MM-YYYY HH24:mi&#039;) as lastanalyze,
	to_char(last_autoanalyze,&#039;DD-MM-YYYY HH24:mi&#039;) as lastautoanalyze
from
	pg_stat_user_tables
order by
	2</code></pre></div><p>Vous n&#039;aurez pas l&#039;historique du déclenchement de l&#039;autovacuum mais au moins la date du dernier lancement par table</p>]]></content>
